{"kind":"html","caption":"用两个同步栈把“找最小值”变成读取栈顶：数据栈保存全部元素，最小栈在每次 push 时保存截至当前位置的最小值。pop 时两个栈同时弹出，因此它们始终一一对应，top 读取数据栈顶，getMin 读取最小栈顶。动画使用示例中的操作序列，展示最小值如何从 -3 恢复为 -2。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>最小栈可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .intro { margin: 0 0 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .formula { color: #3794ff; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .operations { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .op { min-width: 56px; padding: 4px 6px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #2d2d30; color: #8d8d8d; text-align: center; font-size: 10px; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s; }\n  .op.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .op.done { border-color: #3794ff; color: #3794ff; }\n  .op-arg { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size:10px; }\n  .status { margin-bottom: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; border-radius: 4px; background: #2a2d2e; font-size: 12px; }\n  .result { margin-top: 4px; color: #3794ff; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 11px; }\n  .stacks { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .stack-card { padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .stack-card h2 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .stack-note { margin: 0 0 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  .stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column-reverse; gap: 4px; min-height: 100px; padding: 6px; border: 1px dashed #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #1c1c1c; }\n  .stack .cell { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 6px; min-height: 32px; width: auto; padding: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #2d2d30; }\n  .stack .cell.highlight { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .stack .value { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #d4d4d4; }\n  .cell-label { color: #8d8d8d; font-size:10px; text-align: right; }\n  .empty { margin: auto; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; }\n  .rule { padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  .rule-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr; gap: 6px; padding: 4px 0; }\n  .rule-row + .rule-row { border-top: 1px solid #3c3c3c; }\n  .rule-key { color: #3794ff; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .complexity { margin-top: 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 10px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>最小栈：让最小值也拥有自己的栈顶</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">数据栈保存实际元素；最小栈在相同位置保存“到这里为止的最小值”。因此当前最小值始终是最小栈的栈顶。</p>\n\n  <section id=\"operations\" class=\"operations\" aria-label=\"示例操作序列\"></section>\n\n  <section class=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n    <strong id=\"stepTitle\">准备开始</strong>\n    <div id=\"explanation\">动画将依次执行题目示例中的操作。</div>\n    <div id=\"result\" class=\"result\">输出：null</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stacks\">\n    <article class=\"stack-card\">\n      <h2>数据栈</h2>\n      <p class=\"stack-note\">保存每一个 push 进来的真实值，栈顶用于回答 <span class=\"formula\">top()</span>。</p>\n      <div id=\"dataStack\" class=\"stack\"></div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"stack-card\">\n      <h2>最小栈</h2>\n      <p class=\"stack-note\">每层保存 <span class=\"formula\">min(新值, 上一层最小值)</span>，栈顶用于回答 <span class=\"formula\">getMin()</span>。</p>\n      <div id=\"minStack\" class=\"stack\"></div>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"rule\">\n    <div class=\"rule-row\"><span class=\"rule-key\">push(v)</span><span>数据栈压入 <span class=\"formula\">v</span>；最小栈压入当前新最小值。</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rule-row\"><span class=\"rule-key\">pop()</span><span>两个栈同步弹出一层，旧的最小值自然恢复。</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rule-row\"><span class=\"rule-key\">top()</span><span>直接读取数据栈顶。</span></div>\n    <div class=\"rule-row\"><span class=\"rule-key\">getMin()</span><span>直接读取最小栈顶，无需扫描。</span></div>\n    <div class=\"complexity\">四种操作均为 O(1)，额外空间为 O(n)</div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const steps = [\n    { name: '初始化', arg: '', type: 'init', output: 'null', text: '创建两个空栈，它们将始终保持相同层数。' },\n    { name: 'push', arg: '-2', type: 'push', value: -2, output: 'null', text: '数据栈压入 -2；当前只有一个元素，最小栈也压入 -2。' },\n    { name: 'push', arg: '0', type: 'push', value: 0, output: 'null', text: '比较 0 与上一层最小值 -2，新的最小值仍是 -2。' },\n    { name: 'push', arg: '-3', type: 'push', value: -3, output: 'null', text: '比较 -3 与上一层最小值 -2，新的最小值变为 -3。' },\n    { name: 'getMin', arg: '', type: 'getMin', output: '-3', text: '直接读取最小栈顶，得到 -3，不需要遍历数据栈。' },\n    { name: 'pop', arg: '', type: 'pop', output: 'null', text: '两个栈同步弹出顶层；-3 被删除，上一层保存的最小值 -2 自动恢复。' },\n    { name: 'top', arg: '', type: 'top', output: '0', text: '直接读取数据栈顶，得到 0。' },\n    { name: 'getMin', arg: '', type: 'getMin', output: '-2', text: '直接读取最小栈顶，得到恢复后的最小值 -2。' }\n  ];\n\n  const operations = document.getElementById('operations');\n  const dataStackEl = document.getElementById('dataStack');\n  const minStackEl = document.getElementById('minStack');\n  const stepTitle = document.getElementById('stepTitle');\n  const explanation = document.getElementById('explanation');\n  const result = document.getElementById('result');\n  let data = [];\n  let mins = [];\n  let index = 0;\n\n  steps.forEach((step, i) => {\n    const item = document.createElement('div');\n    item.className = 'op';\n    item.dataset.index = String(i);\n    item.innerHTML = '<span class=\"op-name\">' + step.name + '</span>' +\n      (step.arg ? '<span class=\"op-arg\">(' + step.arg + ')</span>' : '<span class=\"op-arg\">()</span>');\n    operations.appendChild(item);\n  });\n\n  function drawStack(element, values, active) {\n    element.innerHTML = '';\n    if (values.length === 0) {\n      const empty = document.createElement('div');\n      empty.className = 'empty';\n      empty.textContent = '空栈';\n      element.appendChild(empty);\n      return;\n    }\n    values.forEach((value, i) => {\n      const cell = document.createElement('div');\n      cell.className = 'cell' + (active === i ? ' highlight' : '');\n      const label = i === values.length - 1 ? '栈顶 · 第 ' + i + ' 层' : '第 ' + i + ' 层';\n      cell.innerHTML = '<span class=\"value\">' + value + '</span><span class=\"cell-label\">' + label + '</span>';\n      element.appendChild(cell);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function reset() {\n    data = [];\n    mins = [];\n    document.querySelectorAll('.op').forEach(el => el.className = 'op');\n  }\n\n  function runStep() {\n    if (index === 0) reset();\n    const step = steps[index];\n    let activeData = -1;\n    let activeMin = -1;\n\n    if (step.type === 'push') {\n      data.push(step.value);\n      const nextMin = mins.length === 0 ? step.value : Math.min(step.value, mins[mins.length - 1]);\n      mins.push(nextMin);\n      activeData = data.length - 1;\n      activeMin = mins.length - 1;\n    } else if (step.type === 'pop') {\n      data.pop();\n      mins.pop();\n      activeData = data.length - 1;\n      activeMin = mins.length - 1;\n    } else if (step.type === 'top') {\n      activeData = data.length - 1;\n    } else if (step.type === 'getMin') {\n      activeMin = mins.length - 1;\n    }\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.op').forEach((el, i) => {\n      el.className = 'op' + (i === index ? ' active' : i < index ? ' done' : '');\n    });\n    stepTitle.textContent = '第 ' + (index + 1) + ' 步：' + step.name + (step.arg ? '(' + step.arg + ')' : '()');\n    explanation.textContent = step.text;\n    result.textContent = '本步输出：' + step.output;\n    drawStack(dataStackEl, data, activeData);\n    drawStack(minStackEl, mins, activeMin);\n\n    index = (index + 1) % steps.length;\n  }\n\n  runStep();\n  setInterval(runStep, 2200);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":"","time_complexity":"O(1)","space_complexity":"O(n)","complexity_note":"n 为栈内元素个数. push、pop、top、getMin 每次均为 O(1), 数据栈与最小栈同步保存 n 层状态."}
